  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The speed of a vehicle is increasing at a rate of <math alttext=\"7.3\"><mn>7.3</mn></math> meters per second squared. What is this rate, in <strong>miles per minute squared</strong>, rounded to the nearest tenth? <math alttext=\"left parenthesis Use 1 mile  equals 1,609 meters period right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mtext>Use</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>mile</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1,609</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>meters.</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
