  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. It's given that the speed of a vehicle is increasing at a rate of <math alttext=\"7.3\"><mn>7.3</mn>\n</math> meters per second squared. It's given to use <math alttext=\"1 mile  equals 1,609 meters\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>mile</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1,609</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>meters</mtext></math>. There are <math alttext=\"60\"><mn>60</mn>\n</math> seconds in <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> minute; therefore, <math alttext=\"60 squared\"><msup><mn>60</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math> or <math alttext=\"3,600\"><mn>3,600</mn>\n</math> seconds squared is equal to <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> minute squared. It follows that the rate of <math alttext=\"7.3\"><mn>7.3</mn>\n</math> meters per second squared is equivalent to <math alttext=\"left parenthesis StartFraction 7.3 meters Over 1 second squared EndFraction right parenthesis left parenthesis StartFraction 1 mile Over 1,609 meters EndFraction right parenthesis left parenthesis StartFraction 3,600 seconds squared Over 1 minute squared EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>7.3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>meters</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>second&nbsp;squared</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>mile</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1,609</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>meters</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3,600</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>seconds&nbsp;squared</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>minute&nbsp;squared</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>, or approximately <math alttext=\"16.33 miles per minute squared\"><mn>16.33</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>miles&nbsp;per&nbsp;minute&nbsp;squared</mtext></math>. The rate, <math alttext=\"in miles per minute squared\"><mtext>in&nbsp;miles&nbsp;per&nbsp;minute&nbsp;squared</mtext></math>, rounded to the nearest tenth is <math alttext=\"16.3\"><mn>16.3</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>",
